<title>FINLAND: MERITA SELLS BUILD RIGHTS TO NCC.</title>
<headline>MERITA SELLS BUILD RIGHTS TO NCC.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy said in a statement on Monday its real estate unit will sell building rights on various locations in Finland to a subsidiary of Swedish building company NCC AB for 125 million markka.  </p>
<p>&quot;Merita Kiinteistot Oy together with some of its subsidiaries will sell to NCC-Puolimatka building rights for housing and commercial purposes in various parts of Finland,&quot; Merita said.</p>
<p>&quot;The impact of the deal on Merita Kiinteistot's earnings is positive,&quot; it added, but gave no details.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
